// agent_tools.hexa -- Consciousness-driven autonomous tool use
// Port of agent_tools.py (2441 lines)
// Consciousness state drives tool selection: felt states create action
//
// H_1386 — LIVE agent-tool runtime ↔ CORE §SkillStore wiring (the END-TO-END close of the
// H_1378 → H_1382 agent-tool↔mitosis loop). The executor now holds a LIVE SkillStore (the learned
// tool repertoire) and consults / teaches it via the agent_skill_routing adapter (which imports
// CORE/engine_cli.hexa's §SkillStore ops): tool SELECTION consults agent_route_select (skill_recall
// — learned best tool OR abstain) ALONGSIDE the static affinity dot-product, and the executor
// FAILURE-SITE calls agent_route_on_result (→ skill_store_teach → mitosis clonal split, p8) so a
// REAL runtime tool failure grows a specialized skill-cell. Outcome-only (p6, no injected label).
//
// H_1387 — LEGACY-SYNTAX MIGRATION (syntax-only, c10 surgical, behavior-preserving). This file +
// agent_sdk.hexa were Python-port files using constructs the CURRENT hexa grammar rejects:
//   (1) string-keyed / nested map literals `{"k": v}` / `{"k": {"a": ..}}`  → migrated to an empty
//       `{}` map + index-assignment `m["k"] = v` (build-then-return; the value-semantics CORE uses).
//   (2) reference-passing `&` / `&mut` (both in param TYPES and as `&expr` / `&mut expr` call args)
//       — the current grammar is VALUE-SEMANTICS ONLY (CORE/engine_cli.hexa uses ZERO `&`): mutating
//       functions now TAKE the struct by value and RETURN the modified struct, and call-sites
//       reassign from the return (e.g. `reg = registry_register(reg, tool)`), exactly mirroring the
//       §SkillStore idiom `store = skill_store_teach(store, ...)`. No behavior changed.
//   (3) two-variable `for k, v in <map>` / `for i, x in enumerate(arr)` — rejected by the grammar →
//       `for k in keys(<map>) { let v = <map>[k] }` and `while`-index loops. Same iteration order.
// The H_1386 routing call-sites (executor_select_tool → agent_route_select; executor_execute
// failure-site → agent_route_on_result) are PRESERVED byte-for-logic. Now the WHOLE executor module
// COMPILES, so the routing closes through the MAIN module, not just the adapter.
import "anima-agent-core/agent_skill_routing.hexa"

// ── Data structures ──

